{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelWeightBoundedness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelWeightBoundedness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Abs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.BigOperators.Group.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.plancherel_weight_boundedness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.plancherel_weight_boundedness","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L97-L113","doc":"**Proposition (Plancherel-weight boundedness)**.\n\nThe Plancherel distribution on partitions of `n` satisfies:\n1. Each weight is in `[0, 1]`.\n2. Sum of weights is `1`.\n\nHence any bounded function `f : Partition → R` has a Plancherel\naverage bounded by `‖f‖_∞`.\n\nStated over any linearly ordered commutative ring (§7c). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:plancherel-weight-boundedness","label":"prop:plancherel-weight-boundedness","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/plancherel-weight-boundedness.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weighted_sum_bounded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weighted_sum_bounded","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L73-L93","doc":"A bounded function on partitions yields a bounded weighted sum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_le_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_le_one","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L61-L71","doc":"Each Plancherel weight is bounded above by 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_sum_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_sum_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.weight","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.partitions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.partitions","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PlancherelDistribution","kind":"structure","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PlancherelWeightBoundedness.lean#L46-L54","doc":"Abstract Plancherel data: a finite indexing set with weights,\nover any linearly ordered commutative ring (§7c: no archimedean\ninput; `ℚ` and `ℝ` are both instances). ","signatureChunk":0}]}